<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.2 pct in October 11-20.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.2 pct in October 11-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.2 percent in the October 11-20 period after rising 0.1 percent in the previous 10 days and were 1.2 percent higher than in September 11-20, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				   OCT 11-20    OCT 1-10   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p> POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     0.2	   0.1	  1.2  (2.4)</p>
<p>  Bread			     0.2	   1.2	  1.6  (1.5)</p>
<p>  Fruit and vegetables	 -1.5	  -7.8	 -5.5 (-0.4)</p>
<p>  Meat and meat-products	0.0	   0.7	  2.1  (4.8)</p>
<p>  Dairy products		  0.4	   0.3	  0.9  (0.7)</p>
<p>  Eggs				1.8	   2.9	  5.6  (4.7)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on October 10.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
